        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          For most homes the best spin mop is the O-Cedar EasyWring RinseClean, because its two-tank bucket keeps dirty rinse water out of the water you mop with. If you want the cheaper classic, the original O-Cedar EasyWring does the same wringing job with one bucket. If your floors are mostly sealed hardwood, skip the bucket and use a flat spray mop like the Bona Premium, which puts down a thin mist instead of a wet head.
